msgid ""
"Note: Workaround mode allows a STA that claims OCV capability to connect "
"even if the STA doesn't send OCI or negotiate PMF."
msgstr ""
"注：权宜模式允许宣称具有 OCV 能力的 STA 进行连接，即使该 STA 并不发送 OCI 或"
"协商 PMF。"

