msgstr "启用或禁用 IEEE 802.11h 以支持（DFS）"

msgid "Advanced Dynamic Frequency Selection (DFS) technology is designed to seamlessly switch DFS channels without interrupting client connections."
msgstr "高级动态频率选择（DFS）技术，旨在‌无缝切换 DFS 信道而不中断客户端连接‌。"

