msgid "If GREENFIELD seems to be unstable,try to use OFDM instead.VHT/HE is only available for 11AC/11AX devices."
msgstr "如果 GREENFIELD 不稳定，请尝试改用 OFDM。VHT/HE 仅适用于 11AC/11AX 设备。"

